DTEND:20261020T170000Z
DESCRIPTION:The FSU Carothers Faculty Lecture Series opens the 2026-27 season with Professors Zina Ward (Philosophy) and Thomas Juzek (Linguistics). They will speak on how AI is shaping human language. This will be a crossover event with FSU Discovery Days! aimed to celebrate and share the cutting edge work being done at FSU. \n\nIf you would like to reserve a free lunch provided by Office of Research\, please RSVP: https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/a50DsqqGpg.
LOCATION:Bradley Reading Room\, Strozier Library
SUMMARY:Carothers Faculty Lecture - Zina Ward and Thomas Juzek
URL;VALUE=URI:https://calendar.fsu.edu/event/carothers-faculty-lecture-zina-ward-and-thomas-jusek
CATEGORIES:Lecture
END:VEVENT
